@startuml
title zmrx receiver — session state machine

top to bottom direction
hide empty description
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  ArrowColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  StartColor #15803D
  EndColor #991B1B
}

[*] -down-> Contact

state "Establish contact" as Contact
Contact : send ZRINIT capabilities
Contact : TIMEOUT or ZRQINIT [attempts < 10] / resend ZRINIT
Contact -down-> Dispatch : other valid header

state "Dispatch session header" as Dispatch
Dispatch : ZRQINIT or stray ZEOF / send ZRINIT
Dispatch : unsupported request / send ZCOMPL
Dispatch : timeout [attempts remain] / send ZRINIT
Dispatch -down-> ReceiveFile : ZFILE
Dispatch -right-> Closing : ZFIN

state "Receive one file" as ReceiveFile
ReceiveFile : success / send ZRINIT
ReceiveFile : skipped or retriable ZFILE error / no invitation
ReceiveFile -up-> Dispatch : handler returns

state "Failed transfer" as TransferFailed
ReceiveFile -right-> TransferFailed : fatal error or retry limit / send ZFERR if possible
Dispatch -right-> TransferFailed : fatal error or retry limit
TransferFailed -up-> Closing : mark process failed

state "Close session" as Closing
Closing : send ZFIN
Closing -down-> WaitOO : success
Closing -right-> Failure : I/O error

state "Wait for OO" as WaitOO
WaitOO -down-> Success : two 'O' bytes received
WaitOO -right-> Failure : timeout or I/O error
Contact -right-> Failure : retry limit, cancellation, or I/O error

state "Successful exit" as Success
state "Failed exit" as Failure
Success -down-> [*]
Failure -down-> [*]

note left of ReceiveFile
  See zmrx-file-state-machine.svg for file policy,
  data framing, commit, and recovery detail.
end note
@enduml
